engine of record is now stated as a label rather than a ref; the story and the licence audit each
say once that their short SHAs are studio-internal or third-party pins.

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - release engineering for this fork; no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED - documents and evidence files only; no code path is touched.
